TI  - Short-term effects of passive listening to an Indian musical scale on blood pressure and heart rate variability among healthy individuals – A randomised controlled trial
PY  - 2022
T2  - Indian Journal of Physiology and Pharmacology
VL  - 61
IS  - 1
SP  - 29
EP  - 44
DO  - 10.25259/IJPP_126_2021
